5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hello everyone. I am the Seer. I will check one person tonight.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Good morning. Let's keep our voices low and observe carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Silence is golden in the early stages of the game.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,Wisdom lies in patience. Let us listen to the wind before we speak.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so excited to start! Let's have a fun and fair game, everyone!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I will divine Shion tonight. Please trust my judgment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Interesting choice. I hope you are confident in your intuition, Kenji.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Why Shion? Is there a specific reason for that target?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,The young one often hides the most secrets. A wise choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Shion seems calm, but I feel a bit of tension around him.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just want to clear the board. Shion, please cooperate.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"I have nothing to hide. My calm is my strength, not a mask.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If you are innocent, you should welcome the check.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,Innocence is a shield. Let the truth reveal itself through the stars.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
