31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I checked Shion last night. He is a Werewolf.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That is a bold accusation. I am a Villager, Kenji.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Kenji, are you sure? This is a serious claim to make.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,The Seer's word is heavy. But let us not rush to judgment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! Shion, is this true? I really hope you are innocent.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I am 100% sure. The result was clear. Shion is the wolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,You are mistaken. I am playing a defensive game. Why trust you?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If Kenji is lying, he is trying to frame an innocent player.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,A lie is a heavy burden. Let us look at the evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I don't want to vote for Shion if he is innocent. Please explain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I have no reason to lie. Shion, your denial is suspicious.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Suspicion is not proof. Ryuji, you are too cautious.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am being logical. We need more data before executing someone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Logic is good, but sometimes the heart sees what the mind misses.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm scared. I don't want to kill the wrong person.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Vote for Shion. He is the only confirmed threat.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,Vote for Kenji. He is the one trying to manipulate you.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will vote for Shion. The Seer's word is the strongest evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I will follow the Seer's lead. Shion, you must go.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm sorry, Shion. I have to trust Kenji. Vote for Shion.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
